      "message": "fix(machines): the 15L's 3 hp from its manual; pin the lathes in the shipped-machine lists\n\nThe contributor's manuals (UM10753 8L, UM10225 15L Slant-PRO) confirm\nevery figure but one: the 15L is 3 hp continuous (2.24 kW), not the\nweb page's 1.5 hp. The shipped-machine expectation list names the two\nlathes; the Tormach Z0 safe-retract law (a mill post's) skips lathes,\nwhich retract on their own post (#612). tormach_lathes pins power.\n\nRefs #611\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
