      "message": "feat(machines): Tormach 15LX Slant-PRO lathe definition\n\nFrom the contributor's UM10860 manual, §3.1: X 10 in, Z 14 in, max\n3500 rpm (no minimum stated - none stated in the file), 6 hp\ncontinuous (4.5 kW), 360 IPM, gang tooling standard (99-entry tool\ntable; the 8-position turret is a kit). Inch, full-stroke-either-way\ntravel. Stacked on #611 (same machine list); pinned in tormach_lathes\nand the shipped-machine expectation list.\n\nFixes #619\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
