      "message": "docs(machines): the lathe travel band's meaning, manual sources; lathes state no Z0 retract\n\nReview of #624: the decision record no longer claims the 8L's 4.5 in\nX 'refuses more, never less' - the +/-s band is the Tormach convention\nand catches gross over-travel only; comments name the operator\nmanuals; tormach_safe_retract asserts a lathe states no mill Z0\nretract instead of skipping it.\n\nRefs #611\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
